  - kind: 1
    emotion: smirk
    text: Rough weather out there, scribe. My boys just opened a back-room parlor
      on Canal Street called the Lily Club. Good Scotch, no uniform crowd.
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: 
    optionB: 
    next: -1
